// 下拉選單：觸發鈕開啟時出現外框、箭頭以彈簧轉 180°；選單由上方縮放彈出，滑過的項目有滑動高亮，選取的勾勾彈出。
import { Theme, Motion } from "../theme.slint";
import { Icon, Icons } from "icons.slint";
import { SwapText } from "motion.slint";

export component Dropdown {
    in property <[string]> items;
    in-out property <int> current: 0;
    in property <string> placeholder;
    in property <bool> enabled: true;
    in property <length> item-height: 38px;
    callback selected(index: int);
    height: 46px;
    min-width: 120px;
    opacity: enabled ? 1 : 0.5;
    accessible-role: combobox;
    accessible-value: current >= 0 && current < items.length ? items[current] : "";
    property <bool> open: popup.is-open;
    Rectangle {
        transform-scale: ta.pressed ? 0.96 : 1;
        animate transform-scale {
            duration: ta.pressed ? Motion.press-dur : Motion.spring-dur;
            easing: ta.pressed ? Motion.press : Motion.spring;
        }
        border-radius: Theme.radius-input;
        background: root.open ? Theme.card : Theme.fill;
        border-width: 1.5px;
        border-color: root.open ? Theme.ink : transparent;
        animate background, border-color { duration: 300ms; }
        HorizontalLayout {
            padding-left: 14px;
            padding-right: 14px;
            spacing: 8px;
            SwapText {
                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                text: root.current >= 0 && root.current < root.items.length ? root.items[root.current] : root.placeholder;
                color: root.current >= 0 && root.current < root.items.length ? Theme.ink : Theme.muted;
                font-size: Theme.fs-base;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            Icon {
                y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                path: Icons.chevron-down;
                color: Theme.ink;
                transform-rotation: root.open ? 180deg : 0deg;
                animate transform-rotation {
                    duration: Theme.reduce-motion ? 420ms : 500ms;
                    easing: Motion.spring;
                }
            }
        }
    }
    ta := TouchArea {
        enabled: root.enabled;
        mouse-cursor: pointer;
        clicked => {
            popup.show();
        }
    }
    popup := PopupWindow {
        // 四周多留 16px 給陰影
        x: -16px;
        y: root.height + 6px - 16px;
        width: root.width + 32px;
        height: root.items.length * root.item-height + 10px + 32px;
        close-policy: PopupClosePolicy.close-on-click-outside;
        menu := Rectangle {
            property <float> t: 0;
            property <float> fade: 0;
            property <int> hl: root.current;
            property <bool> closing;
            init => {
                t = 1;
                fade = 1;
            }
            animate t {
                duration: Motion.spring-dur;
                easing: Motion.spring;
            }
            animate fade { duration: 200ms; }
            x: 16px;
            y: 16px - 8px * (1 - self.t);
            width: parent.width - 32px;
            height: parent.height - 32px;
            opacity: self.fade;
            transform-scale: 0.96 + 0.04 * self.t;
            transform-origin: { x: self.width / 2, y: 0px };
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: Theme.card;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.line;
            drop-shadow-color: Theme.dark ? #00000080 : #0E0F1329;
            drop-shadow-blur: 24px;
            drop-shadow-offset-y: 10px;
            Rectangle {
                x: 5px;
                y: 5px + menu.hl * root.item-height;
                width: parent.width - 10px;
                height: root.item-height;
                border-radius: 11px;
                background: Theme.fill;
                visible: menu.hl >= 0;
                animate y {
                    duration: Theme.reduce-motion ? 420ms : 450ms;
                    easing: Motion.soft;
                }
            }
            for item[i] in root.items: row := Rectangle {
                property <bool> sel: i == root.current;
                property <float> ck: self.sel ? 1 : 0;
                animate ck {
                    duration: Theme.reduce-motion ? 420ms : 500ms;
                    easing: Motion.spring;
                }
                x: 5px;
                y: 5px + i * root.item-height;
                width: parent.width - 10px;
                height: root.item-height;
                HorizontalLayout {
                    padding-left: 10px;
                    padding-right: 10px;
                    Text {
                        text: item;
                        color: Theme.ink;
                        font-size: Theme.fs-md;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                        overflow: elide;
                    }
                    Icon {
                        y: (parent.height - self.height) / 2;
                        width: 16px;
                        height: 16px;
                        path: Icons.check;
                        color: Theme.accent;
                        weight: 2.6;
                        opacity: clamp(row.ck * 2, 0, 1);
                        transform-scale: 0.4 + 0.6 * row.ck;
                    }
                }
                TouchArea {
                    mouse-cursor: pointer;
                    changed has-hover => {
                        if self.has-hover {
                            menu.hl = i;
                        }
                    }
                    clicked => {
                        if root.current != i {
                            root.current = i;
                            root.selected(i);
                        }
                        menu.closing = true;
                    }
                }
            }
            // 選取後讓勾勾彈出再收起選單
            Timer {
                interval: 380ms;
                running: menu.closing;
                triggered => {
                    menu.closing = false;
                    popup.close();
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
